The stream included edge bars and isolated/motif colors, but the sole supplied demo that changed cells changed only two adjacent 5s to 6s (demo 1: rows 2–3, column 1 in zero-based coordinates); demos 2–4 changed only small portions: demo 2 changed three 7s in a 7-bar to 4s, demo 3 changed a 3x2 patch of 8s to 7s, and demo 4 recolored a compact 5-shape to 6. These are distinct local recolorings, not evidence for projecting broad edge rays. Repeated submissions that altered a guessed 3-color edge pattern failed, illustrating the need to fit a selector or relation to all demos before transfer.

